cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper and the archived code."
title: "BGC mixed finite volumes"
abstract: >-
  Direct and mixed gradient-flow finite-volume solvers (C++/PETSc) for the
  fourth-order Bevilacqua-Galeão-Costa (BGC) diffusion equation, with a
  NumPy/SciPy reference implementation and a symbolic check of the
  boundary-closure coefficients.
type: software
